# 23 panels so far; Lower District letter and descent are preserved, then new episode payoff.
p('At the stair top Aren has not opened the black envelope. Pell gently takes it back for a moment to point out its broken-circle seal.', [('Pell','A job offer. Show them this seal. I gave them your name.'),('Aren','Who is them?')],camera='hands and faces',state='Pell holds black envelope; Aren cream wallet closed at belt; torn hem, sleeve still intact.')
