p('Explicit storyboard revision 2: the line is off and the sword is now sheathed. Close from Aren’s anatomical left side: he lowers his eyes toward the torn LEFT elbow sleeve; both empty hands hang naturally outside the close framing. The tear and his rueful face share the frame; no simultaneous weapon handling.', [('Aren','I stopped.'),('Sera','You did. Next time, before the railing.')],camera='tight left-profile face and torn elbow; offscreen Sera upper-left',state='Line OFF. Sword SHEATHED, envelope hidden chest. LEFT elbow tear and torn hem persist; hem outside this close crop. No new wound or blood.')
p('Explicit storyboard revision 2: close insert of Aren’s two gloved hands holding the one intact BLACK envelope against his black shirt. LEFT hand supports its bottom-left corner; right index finger lightly checks the broken silver-circle seal. Torn ivory LEFT elbow edge remains visible. No weapon handling: blade stays sheathed.', [('Aren','Still dry.')],camera='intimate envelope insert, tight crop deliberately excludes hem',state='Envelope held by both hands at chest, blade SHEATHED inactive; grounded lower landing, no line. LEFT elbow and hem tears persist; no new blood.')
p('The envelope is back inside Aren’s coat. With sword still sheathed, he lifts the wicket latch with his LEFT hand. Pell and Sera descend the regular stair through the opening; show the opened passage and the three separate bodies.', [('Pell','First working entrance in six months.')],camera='medium latch and opening passage')
p('Beyond the wicket, a small postal hall is lit by amber lamps. Several adult residents stand patiently with envelopes; an older woman with silver braid and indigo apron waits at a sorting table.', [],camera='wide inhabited interior reveal',state='Aren sword sheathed; envelope hidden. No glass creature inside.')
p('The postmistress Ossa accepts the black envelope from Aren; she reads his name on the inner note, then looks at the torn sleeve.', [('Ossa','Aren Vale. You found the door.'),('Aren','It needed an argument.')],camera='medium counter two-shot')
p('Ossa lays the opened black envelope beside a bundle of ordinary outgoing letters, each with a different hand-written address kept illegible in art.', [('Ossa','We have written for twenty years.'),('Ossa','The returns say no such address.')],camera='tactile letters and worn hands')
