p('Back at Ossa’s counter, Aren returns alone and hands over the signed receipt. Ossa gives him the outgoing bundle and his first small payment; no arbitrary coin total.', [('Ossa','First delivery received.'),('Aren','Keep the door open. I am coming back.')],camera='hands and warm face, reward held not cancelled')
